I added `cheapestStart` at the end of `src/tariff.ts`. It quotes each start day from `fromDay` to `toDay` with `quoteHire` and no pets. It keeps the first day with the lowest `totalPence`, since only a strictly lower total replaces the best, and it returns that day unwrapped.

I couldn't see `quoteHire`, so I'm assuming it accepts start days past 365 and wraps them itself, as you said a hire's start day may run past the year end. If it doesn't, the days after the year end would need wrapping before they are quoted.
